    "coverageGap": "A new listing carried by an MLS other than MetroList would still not be found by the enumeration, because every host that enumerates here republishes MetroList only. The Trulia pass partly covers this — it is portal-wide rather than MetroList-only, and it independently surfaced both known foreign-MLS listings — but it depends on the portal having tagged the pool, so it is a mitigation, not a guarantee. Both known foreign-MLS listings were re-read individually on their own board."
